  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-11-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Fetch fresh standalone Python release data when the cached index is invalid or unreadable ([#2404](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2404)) by @hemcharan710-afk and @gaborbernat.\n- `pipx pin` now lists the packages it pins without `--injected-only` or `--skip` ([#2405](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2405)) by @hemcharan710-afk and @gaborbernat.\n\n[PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.11/)\n\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.10...1.18.11)\n",
